      "updated": 1787995827279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "what is fan out worker?\nworker is a background process that picks up event \nfrom a queue and turns it into N individual writes \n(write to feed + 1 FCM notification) ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "what is fan out worker?\nworker is a background process that picks up event \nfrom a queue and turns it into N individual writes \n(write to feed + 1 FCM notification) ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XVT-pMwKjqMt9XWJrbKoK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1799.7459450888628,
      "y": 3373.972637352007,
      "width": 1766.8990478515625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1823163990,
      "version": 107,
      "versionNonce": 1838376214,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787990740085,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A user has subscribed to multiple channels. what if all the channels post video at the same time. will this create a write amplication problem or the notification will self DoDS itself?\n\nfollow-up question\nIs this problem different from celebrity channel?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A user has subscribed to multiple channels. what if all the channels post video at the same time. will this create a write amplication problem or the notification will self DoDS itself?\n\nfollow-up question\nIs this problem different from celebrity channel?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
